OL,5,G1400 Asian Network Certified...
OL,6,     F...Throwbacks with Haroon Rashid.
OL,7,     FHaroon Rashid plays big anthems
OL,8,     Fand tunes you haven't heard in
OL,9,     Fages! From Bollywood, Bhangra,
OL,10,     Fhip-hop, R&B, UK garage and
OL,11,     FBritish Asian beats all mashed up!
OL,12,G1500 Jaz Singh
OL,13,     FWith the World Cup now underway,
OL,14,     FJaz wants to hear your horror
OL,15,     Fstories. He's giving the mic to
OL,16,     Feveryone with a football-obsessed
OL,17,     Fpartner, who's had the footy
OL,18,     Finterrupt their plans!
OL,19,G1745 Newsbeat @ 17:45
OL,20,     FThe latest news from around the UK
OL,21,     Fand around the world.
